9. What was the Messiah concerned with primarily?





10. Read Lev 13:46. Why does Jesus cleanse the leper and what are the implications?





Application
11. What does it mean to repent and believe in the gospel?





12. What are our attitudes toward Jesus? Have we been treating Him rightly?



13. What do we need to repent of and what would our lives look like if we believe in the gospel?





Prayer
Thank God that our Lord Jesus came to preach the gospel with such urgency that we might repent and
believe. Pray that we will recognise and acknowledge His authority over our lives and the world that we
live in by submitting to Him. Ask God for help to continue turning away from sin and turn to Him instead.
